<title>UK: WestLB unit sets $200 million four-year bond.</title>
<headline>WestLB unit sets $200 million four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Daiwa and Westdeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  WESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.25 PCT  MATURITY    15.NOV.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.08    PAY DATE    15.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.68     SPREAD	+8 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+     DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.225 PCT SELL CONC   1.40 PCT</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND FOUR-YEAR INTERPOLATED U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
